{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f7531910-ae74-89ca-8253-082da5165f99",
  "created_at": "2026-01-08T13:43:06-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Leo Grasso",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:38:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:38:38-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, good afternoon. I'm calling about the storm drain in front of my house. It's, um, it's not draining right. Again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:38:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sorry about that. Can I get the address where the drain is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:38:51-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One twenty Malbone Road. North End. The drain is right in front, by the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:38:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One twenty Malbone Road. Got it. And what's it doing, exactly? Is this from the storm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:39:03-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no storm. Is dry, no rain nothing. But the drain, it's grunting, you know? Making a noise, gurgling, and is very slow. Any time we have a thaw, the snow melt, the water comes up and sits in the street. Backs up all the way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:39:20-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's the melting snow, and the water backs up out of the drain and pools. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:39:27-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. Today is a little warm, so already it's coming. Is a big puddle, like, across the front of my place. I have a business, people come and park, and they got to walk through."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:39:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Have you reported this before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:39:43-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes! I called already, a while ago. And the person told me, that is a state road. So the city, they can't do it, I need to call the state. Okay, so I called the state, and nobody, nothing. Nobody came."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:39:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So you were told Malbone Road is a state road, and you followed up with the state and haven't heard back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:40:06-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. And I don't know, is it true? Because the drain, it's the city's drain, no? I pay taxes here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:40:14-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me look at that. Hang on one second while I pull up the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:40:20-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:40:22-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Okay, I'm still here. Part of Malbone is a state-maintained road, that's true, and that can make who handles the drain a little tricky. But I'm going to put this in as a request on our end so someone looks at that drain and figures out whose it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:40:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So you open a work order? For real?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:40:44-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can enter a request, yes. I'll put in one twenty Malbone Road, storm drain slow and backing up during thaws, no rain involved."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:40:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. And what date? When they come? Because I need a date. Last time nobody gave me nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:41:00-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I can't give you a firm date from this desk. The crew supervisor schedules the inspections once the request comes through. What I can do is get it entered today, Thursday, so it's on record from today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:41:14-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, but is that, like, a number? A work order number I can say when I call back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:41:21-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Once it's saved, yes, it'll have a reference number. Can I get a phone number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:41:30-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Four zero one, five five five, zero one five eight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:41:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one five eight. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:41:40-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Leo Grasso. G-R-A-S-S-O."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:41:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Leo Grasso, thank you. Is there anything else about it that would help the crew? Like where exactly the water goes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:41:50-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it freezes too. At night the puddle, it becomes ice, and in the morning is very dangerous. My daughter, her bus now comes very early in the morning, like before it's light, and she has to walk there on the ice. That's what bothers me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:42:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's good to know, I'll add that the water freezes overnight near the curb and that there's a child waiting for a bus. That should help with priority."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:42:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Because I'm telling you, is not the first time. Every winter, the same."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:42:24-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Let me read it back. One twenty Malbone Road, North End, storm drain slow and gurgling, backs up on thaws, ice forming overnight, previously told it was a state road. Contact Leo Grasso at the number you gave. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:42:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's it. And somebody calls me with the date, yes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:42:45-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll note that you're asking for a scheduled date, and the supervisor's office will get back to you. If you don't hear anything in a few days, call us and give the reference number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:42:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I hope this time is different. Thank you, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T13:43:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Grasso. Be careful on that ice. Bye now."
    }
  ],
